            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                12,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_keepers",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "isle_ilva_year_told",
            "onFailure": "isle_ilva_year_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "isle_ilva_pointing_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“One side. All of them.” She lets it sit. “At the island. Not at the open water, not at the reef — at the island, which has a chapel on it and eleven houses and nothing else and never has had.” A pause. “I have thought about that a great deal, at night.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "isle_wreck_pointing"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "isle_ilva_pointing_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "isle_ilva_pointing_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_keepers",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "isle_ilva_pointing_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "isle_ilva_year_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“In my mother's time. One year, and never again.” She folds her hands. “There are people alive who took eggs off that strip as children. Nella's count has the column and the column stops.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
